{"id":130828387829062,"name":"Catch a Pet [🐾]","desc":"🐾 Welcome to Catch a Pet🥚\n\nDive into Catch a Pet, the ultimate creature-collecting adventure where exploration and discovery are in your hands. Travel across vibrant islands to find and capture rare pets—each with hundreds of thousands of possible variations. Grow your collection, master your tools, collect the rarest pets!\n\n[How To Catch]\n• Hold down to cast your lasso\n• When you're ready to lasso, hold down or click to pull the rope tight. Guide the loop along the black path as closely as you can—don’t worry if you slip up a little, just stay on track to make the catch!\n• When the progress bar on the bottom is full, you'll reel in your catch!","path":"/game/130828387829062-catch-a-pet","slug":"130828387829062-catch-a-pet","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/91d4d7c1ee2c679af10c9b2cf165e996962debf134eda1d0947acb098b68d7d5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a654d947d474a257e594f49952fbebe1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":161341,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-08T04:17:56.911Z","creator":{"name":"Yo_boom","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Catch-a-Pet-autofarm-keyless-57126","_id":"68e5e5f4467c47b2c3b14b44","title":"autofarm keyless","game":{"_id":"68e3ab0e1d70cbf2d2fa6682","gameId":130828387829062,"name":"Catch a Pet [🐾]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":130828387829062},"features":"autofarm yay keyless \nalso need best lasso to catch all\nand need to have ur lasso equiped\nalso use https://scriptblox.com/script/Catch-a-Pet-Dupe-Placed-Animal-57048\nto dupe","tags":[],"script":"\tlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\n\tlocal chr = player.Character\n\tlocal hrp = chr.HumanoidRootPart\n    hrp.Anchored = true\nwhile task.wait() do\n\tlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\n\tlocal chr = player.Character\n\tlocal hrp = chr.HumanoidRootPart\n\n\tfor _, zone in pairs(workspace.Map.Zones:GetChildren()) do\n\t\tif zone:IsA(\"BasePart\") then\n\t\t\thrp.CFrame = zone.CFrame * CFrame.new(0, -10, 0)\n\t\t\ttask.wait(0.5)\n\t\t\tfor _, v in pairs(workspace:GetChildren()) do\n\t\t\t\tif v:IsA(\"Model\") and v:FindFirstChild(\"PetHumanoid\") then\n\t\t\t\t\tlocal petId = v:GetAttribute(\"PetId\")\n\t\t\t\t\tif petId then\n\t\t\t\t\t\tlocal events = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"Events\"):WaitForChild(\"Lasso\")\n\t\t\t\t\t\tevents:WaitForChild(\"PetHit\"):FireServer(petId)\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttask.wait(0.1)\n\t\t\t\t\t\tevents:WaitForChild(\"EndGame\"):FireServer(true)\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n","owner":{"_id":"660aed3f3ac90cfbaaa0ef0f","username":"tiam","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d4fac5d01733ece9f2b1571cf0fc05534c14a2defe143e16cc8ada5462600635.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660aed3f3ac90cfbaaa0ef0f-1717016771142.png"},"status":"offline","id":"660aed3f3ac90cfbaaa0ef0f","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.views","tier":1000000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d4fac5d01733ece9f2b1571cf0fc05534c14a2defe143e16cc8ada5462600635.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/660aed3f3ac90cfbaaa0ef0f-1717016771142.png"}},"verified":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/v235R3HrCQ","views":6055,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/8caffdd67827900aaaf0399b644f77eb6e0ef027d06fc3806fea2cc9765514a0.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-658d3c6cf1d1c2f33262a357ddf51bd2-5988b23a0a4b.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-658d3c6cf1d1c2f33262a357ddf51bd2-5988b23a0a4b.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-10-08T04:17:56.912Z","editBy":{"_id